    "stepId": "hinge-and-telescoping",
    "id": "hinge-and-telescoping",
    "claimId": "lem:binomial-double-cumulative",
    "purpose": "Unpack the supporting discrete calculation.",
    "explanation": "The appendix rewrites the comparison as a Laplace integral of a hinge transform and uses a binomial telescoping identity to establish its sign and a strict positive knot. The formal targets cover the nonnegative and strict hinge statements and the polynomial identity. The guide does not independently validate the algebra or the exposition-to-target translations. The supplied correspondence uses radius \u221at for J(t), radius 1-c for its positive knot, and a sign change on both sides of the general-radius polynomial identity. These translation steps retain their attributed status.",
